"""Question bank for the Sakila AI agent (from the team's SAKILA AI AGENT TESTBANKS file).

Each entry: q (question), tools (what to call), guide (how a correct answer is built — facts come from tools),
must (keywords a good answer contains), avoid (claims a good answer must NOT make).
The agent retrieves the closest entries for every question (src/agent.py), and
scripts/run_testbank.py grades a live agent against this file.
"""

G = lambda q, tools, guide, must=(), avoid=(): {"q": q, "tools": list(tools), "guide": guide, "must": list(must), "avoid": list(avoid)}

